{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in singleprofile RNA-only settings, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4106 and F1 score of 0.3785, lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.5203 and 0.4982). The result suggests scgpt may underperform in singleprofile configurations, but the cause—whether the encoder itself or the profile setting—is not isolated. Further comparisons with other encoders or configurations are needed to clarify its viability."
}

